  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Yo what's up guys, how are you? Welcome back to another game video, so today we are going for the GD5, so just so that you guys can remember that in the last episode, we put all of our money in the last episode of Los Santos, the most expensive and the most expensive car showroom,",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 18.0
    },
    {
      "text": "but the problem is that the customers will come in when they will come in the car, that means we had no money to buy a car, the whole showroom was empty, so we started repairing the business,",
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 31.0
    },
    {
      "text": "we went to the house to buy the car, and repair the car with the money, but the only problem was that we didn't have the chance to get more money,",
      "start": 31.0,
      "end": 39.0
    },
    {
      "text": "that's why I went to a car auction to buy a rare car, wow!",
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 54.0
    }
  ],
